I'm all for {ogre} if it parses.

Just so you know, generally ogres are small giants (a race created
separate of man), orcs are traditionally evil demons or soul-corrupted
and mutilated elves. So it really depends on the mythos, but "giant",
"small-giant" (ogre), "elf", "corrupt-elf" (orc).

